When a **logged-in** user with an existing role (e.g. a doctor) taps "Switch to Request Coverage" and lands on `/(onboarding)/requester/basic-profile`, pressing back fires `router.replace('/(auth)/role-select')` because `requester_onboarding_complete` is false — dumping them on the auth screen instead of back on their account tab.

