| Single-day (any duration) | ❌ Never |
| 24hr straight (continuous) | ❌ Never |
| Multi-day, NOT last day | ✅ Yes |
| Multi-day, last day (`current_day === coverage_length`) | ❌ Never |

So **Pause only appears** when: `coverage_length > 1` AND `current_day < coverage_length`

