## Complete Button Matrix — Final Locked Version

| Status | Shift Type | Condition | Doctor Sees | Requester Sees |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Upcoming** | Any | Before start | Call + Cancel Shift | Call + Cancel Shift + Start Shift |
| **Paused** | Multi-day | Between days | Call | Call + Resume Shift + End Shift |
| **Active** | Single-day / 24hr straight | During shift | Call | Call + End Shift |
| **Active** | Multi-day | Not last day | Call | Call + Pause Shift + End Shift |
| **Active** | Multi-day | Last day (`current_day === coverage_length`) | Call | Call + End Shift |
| **Payment Pending** | Any | After End Shift | Nothing | Payment screen |

